{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "d63b585c1faa982ae45c266863577dbe18486789b3574c9096e0e36c01779cc7", "ja": "まあ、すごい歓声……！　このみちゃん、\nあんなに小さいのにみんなをまとめて、えらいわ～。", "zh": "哎呀，欢声雷动的……！\n木实小小年纪却能领导众人，好了不起啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "62d6f424f5d7198e7a5ffddfa762889dd896e6b04bb6cffa622f7dba3fea3bf1", "ja": "まるで、しっかり者のお姉さんみたいね♪", "zh": "感觉就像一个可靠的大姊姊呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1024_p", "source_sha256": "96cb48e2783c36675bed6b599b78ea4e47e4cd100bf5b3c8480df8bc2f469215", "ja": "あ……いや、あの……あずささん。\nこのみさんは、見た目はあんな感じですけど……。", "zh": "啊……不是，那个……梓小姐。\n木实虽然看起来娇小，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "e4cbdc3888a676a8f8ed6f73ecd0f3829380792c5d6232f2856b8388eff68b8e", "ja": "{$P$}！　あ、伊織達もいるぞ。\nもう舞台袖に来てたんだね！", "zh": "{$P$}！啊，伊织她们也在耶。\n都已经到舞台侧边了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "6fcde364dd21111178d7273334b3cb3d3e9d7696fbfab45254b73234b66d627c", "ja": "お疲れさまです、あずささん！\nそれに、伊織もやよいも。みんな気合い入ってるね！", "zh": "辛苦了，阿梓姊！\n还有伊织跟弥生也是，大家都干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "74e37e8c70f053bcc1ddb065218006654d9e7c733aa9ea24065041646ca6b36b", "ja": "うふふっ、そうね。\n今日は私も、気合い充分なのよ。え～い♪", "zh": "唔呵呵，对啊。\n今天我也很有干劲喔，嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "f5a3c0ddc9e90fd3aa42d8fd70723aa7557a689a79f5b6c4f3d5145ce6e3afb2", "ja": "自分も気合い入りまくりだぞ！　控え室のモニターで\n見てたんだけど、ウズウズして来ちゃったぐらいだし！", "zh": "本人也是干劲满满的喔！本人在准备室的\n萤幕上看到表演，兴奋得忍不住跑过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "7e8e901d27e25cfe986cbab1f44498ad7f50f9bc1fc7030eaf3cdb6712ba6bf5", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}、今日の海美、\nすごいよね！？　バッチリきまってるぞ！", "zh": "欸，{$P$}，今天的海美\n很厉害对吧！？表现得超棒的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1030_p", "source_sha256": "da68a3e129053d58f0ca632ea25134145b58f83d2ff33a0764a034c824ea8135", "ja": "そうだな。普段と比べて、\n一段上のパフォーマンスだと思うよ。", "zh": "对啊，我觉得跟平时比起来，\n她的表现又更上一层楼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "f67c86b9189c7d12709183eff5bf6555aa03fd96220a277395a520e8ff92f756", "ja": "これって、自分とダンス勝負したおかげだよね？\nふふ～ん♪　鼻が高いぞ～♪", "zh": "这应该是因为海美有跟本人比赛舞蹈吧？\n呵呵～♪真替她感到骄傲呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "05e83e9e1c6c728963c79201b400c0d68ae03fc77053331de530470dbcb0940f", "ja": "他のみんなも、すごいですよ……！　みんな歩に\nちゃんと合わせて、ピッタリ揃ってる。", "zh": "其他人也都很厉害喔……！\n大家都整齐划一地配合步的动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "e52231652e340053c2270dbdd924f1a90aff2f5520f987e12e3c312677340150", "ja": "くぅ～、思わず見入っちゃうよ！\nボクも早くステージに立ちたいなぁ……！", "zh": "哎～忍不住就看得入迷了！\n在下也想快点站到舞台上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "edee2530d4d83a7d46fc9a7c0f1144e93f25cfa4781a32e92d67cd6bde7ad9f7", "ja": "あら、真。それって、負けを認めたってこと？\n案外だらしないのね。", "zh": "哎呀，真，你这话的意思是你认输了？\n没想到你这么没志气啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "784ca7f85c4bae6d6ae69f89ec77b3fc61061871f0bb019df8a3428f9603813f", "ja": "な、なんだよそれ！？\nボクはただ、すごいって言っただけじゃないか！", "zh": "你、你在说什么啊！？\n在下刚刚只说她们很厉害而已啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
