{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "26902a4253d2a2d08b79402f501df93b369539b4335a166586ba5dc6f71da2f3", "ja": "なんだよ、もう。\nじゃあ伊織は、何が必要だって言うのさ！", "zh": "到底在说什么啊，受不了。\n那伊织你说，偶像需要的是什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "33c1fef526e0c3d54da7cd9becebe986d904fced7a996ccc501a6619af0e6435", "ja": "それ、自分も知りたいぞ～。\n伊織、アイドルに必要なことってなに？", "zh": "本人也想知道喔～\n伊织，当偶像需要有什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_030_1040_007ior", "source_sha256": "ed82418834093eeeb02d79c0c1e6a7e6798e59b51f6a46002e37dc9e11f43f5e", "ja": "そ、それはだから……ええっと……。\nいろいろあるけど……。", "zh": "那、那个，就是说……呃……\n有很多很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
